iant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T22:33:57-07:00","id":1235442,"title":"","content":"Sounds fun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T22:34:14-07:00","id":1235444,"title":"","content":"I'm game. Been wanting to try out the character creation rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T22:47:48-07:00","id":1235448,"title":"","content":"And that is more than enough for this test run! Thank you.<br /> <br /> Since this is not intended for an actual game, we don't need to conform our concepts to a premise (unless we want). Bad news; we don't have a starting premise. So the first hurdle will be character concepts. (I look forward to getting to the Geist creation section to see how Second Chances defines the Titanic friend).<br /> <br /> So, who were our actors before they died? How did they die and how did it change them?<br /> Strictly speaking, this is also where we should pick our Aspirations (but not our Burden one; wrath upon your murderer comes later if you are Vengeful). While I have a tendancy to refine what these are as I go along the process, we should come up with at least one each, right?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T23:00:24-07:00","id":1235454,"title":"","content":"Yeah, we probably should.<br /> <br /> ------<br /> <br /> <b>Name</b>: Sadaam Premraj <br /> <b>Concept</b>: Ismaili Firefighter <br /> <i>A heroic firefighter who helps the ghosts of children pass on.</i><br /> <br /> <b>ST Aspiration</b>: Put the ghost haunting his Khane to rest.<br /> <b>ST Aspiration</b>: Make a fire safety presentation for the community.<br /> <b>LT Aspiration</b>: Attain the rank of captain.<br /> <br /> And since I know it already...<br /> <br /> <b>Geist</b>: The Frozen Child<br /> <br /> ....<br /> <br /> <b>Edit</b>: I always learn something when I make a new character. <a href=\"https://www.livescience.com/33293-dalmatians-official-firehouse-dogs.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.livescience.com/33293-da...ouse-dogs.html</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 07-16-2018, 02:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T23:50:33-07:00","id":1235463,"title":"","content":"I think I'll recycle a rejected idea from 1st edition to see how far we can stretch the system...less research though. \ud83d\ude22<br /> ______<br /> <br /> <b>Name: </b>Laura Dunaway<br /> <b>Concept: </b>Dark Horse Valedictorian<br /> <i>Party Girl/Slasher Victim turned overarchiever.</i><br /> <br /> <b>ST Aspiration:</b> Make that trip up to Sarah.<br /> <b>ST Aspiration: </b>Make up my History final.<br /> <b>LT Aspiration: </b>Stop the Smilemaker* from hurting more people.<br /> <br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Yeah, it is a little out there. I did say it was a rejected concept. Basically it is that friend in a slasher flim who convinces the Final Girl to go out in the woods for a weekend getaway/camping trip/unsupervised party and then gets killed. This one came back.<br /> <br /> *stand in name for the serial killer/Slasher; because he gives the victim's a second smile.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 07-17-2018, 01:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T09:28:40-07:00","id":1235584,"title":"","content":"I'm am intrigued to see this experiment play out. Like a live CC session example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T14:47:55-07:00","id":1235723,"title":"","content":"<b>Name: </b>Nathaniel Silver<br /> <b>Concept</b><b>:</b> Artist of Death<br /> <i>\u200bwannabe memorabilia collector which express the Underworld in his art</i><br /> <br /> <b>ST Aspiration:</b> find a memento for his collection<br /> <b>ST Aspiration:</b> draw a portrait of a ghost <br /> <b>LT Aspiration:</b> present a show in a gallery dedicated to death and the dead<br /> <br /> <b>Geist: </b>the Black Patron<br /> <br /> ---------------------------------------<br /> <br /> I love art, I love the concept of memorabilia collector, it only makes sense I'll make such a character :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T11:29:26-07:00","id":1236031,"title":"","content":"Here's something from I want to adapt for 2nd Ed.<br /> <br /> <b>Name:</b> Myles Waylon<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Reformed Dread Pirate<br /> <i>He now acts as a</i> <i>ferry captain for small harbor towns.</i><br /> <br /> <b>ST Aspiration:</b> To protect his ferry and passengers.<br /> <b>ST Aspiration</b><b>: </b>To make death less scary for others.<br /> <b>LT Aspiration:</b> find gates to death affirming Underworld realms.<br /> <br /> <b>Geist: </b>The Dead Republic (amalgamate of ghost from the Republic of Pirates)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6516-mefathiel8","name":"mefathiel8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T13:58:07-07:00","id":1236127,"title":"","content":"<b>Name:</b> Eric Taylor<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Penitent daddy's boy<br /> <br /> <b>ST Aspiration:</b> Show to himself and the others he's worth for this 2nd chance.<br /> <b>ST Aspiration</b><b>: </b>Atone for his stupid behavior and it's consequences.<br /> <b>LT Aspiration:</b> Unveal something about his own geist. .<br /> <br /> <b>Geist: </b>The Devil Maiden<br /> <br /> <b>PS:</b> If someone is planning to try a chronicle on a play by post, I'm willing to join!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","user":"Ipergigio","date":". 07-17-2018, 06:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T14:29:52-07:00","id":1236143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ipergigio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1235430-kicking-the-tires-of-2e?p=1236127#post1236127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>PS:</b> If someone is planning to try a chronicle on a play by post, I'm willing to join!</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't speak for everyone, but that is not my intent.<br /> <br /> Well we have enough concepts now, that I think we can move on. The next step is boring and by the numbers. Attribute time, choose your catagories and place your dots.<br /> <br /> I'll do mine later today. Got work to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T20:10:33-07:00","id":1236275,"title":"","content":"Sorry I'm late, had something else I needed to do. Guess I'll hit two steps in one post.<br /> <br /> <b>Name</b>: Dolores Waverly<br /> <b>Concept</b>: The Iron Lady of the society pages<br /> <br /> <b>Asperations</b>:<ul><li>Put a ghost in her debt</li> <li>Acquire a necromancer's journals (A specific necromancer, she hasn't just got a craving.)</li> <li>Found her own Krewe</li> </ul><br /> <b>Geist</b>: The Devil Dog (though she is known to call him &quot;Pooky.&quot;)<br /> <br /> <u><b>Attributes</b></u><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"width: 500px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Int\u25cf\u25cf</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Strength \u25cf</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Presence \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Wits \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Dex \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Manip \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Resolve \u25cf\u25cf</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Stamina \u25cf\u25cf</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Composure \u25cf\u25cf</td> </tr> </table></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad